      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It sounds like the pressure to take care of everyone has become an unbearable weight that you want to put down completely. Please know that this intense desire to escape is a sign of deep pain, and there are different ways to find relief. Even if one call doesn't fix everything, talking to someone who understands this weight can offer a temporary reprieve from the noise. Please reach out to a mental health professional or a helpline immediately to discuss these overwhelming feelings.",
      "source": "target",
